{"questions":[{"question_id":"luz2ux88","content":"<p>On reaction of Lead Sulphide with dilute nitric acid which of the following is not formed?</p>","chapter":"p-block-elements","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift","permalink":"pon-reaction-of-lead-sulphide-with-dilute-nitric-acid-whic-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-oih2vqlcccbquicq","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>On reaction of Lead Sulphide with dilute nitric acid which of the following is not formed?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Sulphur\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Nitric oxide\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Lead nitrate\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Nitrous oxide"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>When lead sulphide (PbS) reacts with dilute nitric acid, the reaction is a redox process where lead sulphide is oxidized and nitric acid is reduced. The overall reaction involves the transformation of PbS and HNO<sub>3</sub> to form lead nitrate (Pb(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>), sulphur, and nitrogen oxides, along with water. The specific nitrogen oxide formed depends on the reaction conditions, including the concentration of nitric acid and the temperature. Typically, with dilute nitric acid, nitric oxide (NO) and nitrogen dioxide (NO<sub>2</sub>) are more common products than nitrous oxide (N<sub>2</sub>O).</p>\n\n<p>The general reaction can be represented as:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"47.349ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 20928.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">SO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1233,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(14868.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(15869.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(17405.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(18227.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(19228.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(19728.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">NO</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>Or, under some conditions, sulphur (S) may also be one of the products instead of or in addition to SO<sub>2</sub>:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38.392ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 16969.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">S</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13832.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(14832.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(15332.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>From the reaction above, you can see:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Sulphur (<b>Option A</b>) can be formed depending on the specific conditions of the reaction, making it a potentially correct product.</li>\n<li>Nitric oxide (<b>Option B</b>) is typically produced when dilute nitric acid reacts with PbS, making it a correct product.</li>\n<li>Lead nitrate (<b>Option C</b>) is definitely formed in the reaction, making it a correct product.</li>\n<li>However, Nitrous oxide (<b>Option D</b>) is <b>not</b> a typical product of the reaction of lead sulphide with dilute nitric acid. It could be formed under special circumstances in reactions involving nitrogen compounds, but it's not a standard outcome for the conditions described.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer to the question is <b>Option D: Nitrous oxide</b>. It is not a typical product of the reaction of lead sulphide with dilute nitric acid under normal conditions.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>लेड सल्फाइड की तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल की अभिक्रिया से निम्न में से किसका निर्माण नहीं होता है ?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"सल्फर"},{"identifier":"B","content":"नाइट्रिक ऑक्साइड\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"लेड नाइट्रेट\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"नाइट्रस ऑक्साइड\n"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>जब लेड सल्फाइड (PbS) तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल के साथ अभिक्रिया करता है, तो यह अभिक्रिया एक रेडॉक्स प्रक्रिया है जिसमें लेड सल्फाइड का ऑक्सीकरण होता है और नाइट्रिक अम्ल अपचयित होता है। समग्र अभिक्रिया में PbS और HNO<sub>3</sub> का रूपांतरण होकर लेड नाइट्रेट (Pb(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>), सल्फर, और नाइट्रोजन ऑक्साइड, जल के साथ बनते हैं। निर्मित विशिष्ट नाइट्रोजन ऑक्साइड अभिक्रिया की परिस्थितियों पर निर्भर करता है, जिसमें नाइट्रिक अम्ल की सांद्रता और तापमान शामिल हैं। सामान्यतः, तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल के साथ, नाइट्रिक ऑक्साइड (NO) और नाइट्रोजन डाइऑक्साइड (NO<sub>2</sub>) नाइट्रस ऑक्साइड (N<sub>2</sub>O) की तुलना में अधिक सामान्य उत्पाद हैं।</p>\n\n<p>सामान्य अभिक्रिया को इस प्रकार दर्शाया जा सकता है:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"47.349ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 20928.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">SO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1233,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(14868.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(15869.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(17405.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(18227.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(19228.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(19728.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">NO</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>अथवा, कुछ परिस्थितियों में, सल्फर (S) भी SO<sub>2</sub> के स्थान पर या उसके अतिरिक्त उत्पादों में से एक हो सकता है:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38.392ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 16969.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">S</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13832.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(14832.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(15332.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>उपरोक्त अभिक्रिया से, आप देख सकते हैं:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>सल्फर (<b>विकल्प A</b>) अभिक्रिया की विशिष्ट परिस्थितियों के आधार पर बन सकता है, जो इसे संभावित रूप से सही उत्पाद बनाता है।</li>\n<li>नाइट्रिक ऑक्साइड (<b>विकल्प B</b>) सामान्यतः तब उत्पन्न होता है जब तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल PbS के साथ अभिक्रिया करता है, जो इसे एक सही उत्पाद बनाता है।</li>\n<li>लेड नाइट्रेट (<b>विकल्प C</b>) निश्चित रूप से अभिक्रिया में बनता है, जो इसे एक सही उत्पाद बनाता है।</li>\n<li>हालांकि, नाइट्रस ऑक्साइड (<b>विकल्प D</b>) तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल के साथ लेड सल्फाइड की अभिक्रिया का एक <b>विशिष्ट</b> उत्पाद <b>नहीं</b> है। यह नाइट्रोजन यौगिकों से संबंधित अभिक्रियाओं में विशेष परिस्थितियों में बन सकता है, लेकिन वर्णित परिस्थितियों के लिए यह एक मानक परिणाम नहीं है।</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>इसलिए, प्रश्न का सही उत्तर <b>विकल्प D: नाइट्रस ऑक्साइड</b> है। यह सामान्य परिस्थितियों में तनु नाइट्रिक अम्ल के साथ लेड सल्फाइड की अभिक्रिया का एक विशिष्ट उत्पाद नहीं है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"group-16-elements-oxygen-family","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["odd_one_out"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Sulphur\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Nitric oxide\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Lead nitrate\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Nitrous oxide"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>When lead sulphide (PbS) reacts with dilute nitric acid, the reaction is a redox process where lead sulphide is oxidized and nitric acid is reduced. The overall reaction involves the transformation of PbS and HNO<sub>3</sub> to form lead nitrate (Pb(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>), sulphur, and nitrogen oxides, along with water. The specific nitrogen oxide formed depends on the reaction conditions, including the concentration of nitric acid and the temperature. Typically, with dilute nitric acid, nitric oxide (NO) and nitrogen dioxide (NO<sub>2</sub>) are more common products than nitrous oxide (N<sub>2</sub>O).</p>\n\n<p>The general reaction can be represented as:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"47.349ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 20928.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">SO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1233,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(14868.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(15869.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(17405.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(18227.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(19228.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(19728.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">NO</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>Or, under some conditions, sulphur (S) may also be one of the products instead of or in addition to SO<sub>2</sub>:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.568ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38.392ex\" height=\"2.265ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 16969.1 1000.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">PbS</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2022.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3022.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3522.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">HNO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1833,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Pb(NO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3033,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10751.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">)</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12009.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(13010.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">S</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13832.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(14832.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(15332.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(16369.1,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">O</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>From the reaction above, you can see:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Sulphur (<b>Option A</b>) can be formed depending on the specific conditions of the reaction, making it a potentially correct product.</li>\n<li>Nitric oxide (<b>Option B</b>) is typically produced when dilute nitric acid reacts with PbS, making it a correct product.</li>\n<li>Lead nitrate (<b>Option C</b>) is definitely formed in the reaction, making it a correct product.</li>\n<li>However, Nitrous oxide (<b>Option D</b>) is <b>not</b> a typical product of the reaction of lead sulphide with dilute nitric acid. It could be formed under special circumstances in reactions involving nitrogen compounds, but it's not a standard outcome for the conditions described.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer to the question is <b>Option D: Nitrous oxide</b>. It is not a typical product of the reaction of lead sulphide with dilute nitric acid under normal conditions.</p>"}]}